{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioAddRepo",
  "$description": "The repository picker: every repo the platform's account link can reach, filtered by name, and one of them adopted as a Jx project. Two flows share it — Add existing repository, and Open Project on a platform whose projects ARE repositories — so the headline is state rather than text. A `jx-dialog`, so the platform owns modality, Escape, focus restoration and the backdrop, which is what retired the `sp-underlay` this surface used to paint beside a fixed card and the `z-index: 1000` that card needed to climb back out from under its own scrim. There is no confirming button: each row commits itself, because a picker whose answer is one of N rows has N answers rather than one. Nothing here knows what `not_jx_project` means, which permission counts as write, or that a Jx-tagged repository sorts first — `new-project/add-repo-modal.ts` keeps the listing, the ordering and the adoption, and hands over rows that are already strings and booleans.",
  "tagName": "jx-dialog",
  "$props": {
    "headline": {
      "$ref": "#/state/title"
    },
    "confirmLabel": "",
    "cancelLabel": "Cancel",
    "size": "md"
  },
  "attributes": {
    "part": "add-repo"
  },
  "oncancel": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "onclose": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "Seventeen `.add-repo-*` rules in `styles/overlays.css` become the parts below, and four of them do not travel: `.add-repo-modal .new-project-modal-body` inherited a fixed card, a scroll body and a border from `.new-project-modal`, and a modal `<dialog>` is every one of those; `.add-repo-refresh` and its hover and disabled variants drew a button by hand, and the refresh is a `jx-button` now. The row's own `font-size: 13px` goes with them: a `<button>` does not inherit type, which is what `font: inherit` is for, and what it now inherits is the dialog's own body size rather than a number this surface picked. Six token repairs travel with the rest — `--spectrum-font-size-50` and `--spectrum-font-size-75` resolve only inside `<sp-theme>`, and a document mounted in the dialog layer is outside it, so every one of them would silently have taken its hard-coded fallback — and the two links lose the hard-coded blue they carried as a fallback behind `var(--accent)`, which is the same bug written the other way round.",
    "& [part=\"picker\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "$description": "The list scrolls, not the dialog. `jx-dialog` already scrolls its own body, so a cap here looks redundant — it is not: the filter above the list and the access footer below it are the two things that widen a listing that is missing what the reader came for, and a dialog that scrolls as one takes both of them off screen exactly when the list is long enough to need them.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "maxHeight": "320px",
      "overflowY": "auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "$description": "A whole row is the button, because the answer is the repository rather than a control inside it. `baseline` rather than `center`: the name and the metadata beside it are different sizes, and aligning their boxes leaves the two strings visibly off each other.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "width": "100%",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2) var(--jx-space-3)",
      "background": "none",
      "border": "none",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "cursor": "pointer",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "&:hover:not([disabled])": {
        "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
      },
      "&[disabled]": {
        "$description": "Every row goes quiet while any one of them is importing: one adoption at a time, and the row that is running says so itself rather than the list going grey around it.",
        "opacity": "0.6",
        "cursor": "default"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"name\"]": {
      "color": "var(--accent)"
    },
    "& [part=\"meta\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"badge\"]": {
      "padding": "0 var(--jx-space-2)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-lg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"busy\"]": {
      "$description": "Pushed to the far end of the row it belongs to, so \"Importing…\" reads as this repository's state rather than as another piece of its metadata.",
      "marginLeft": "auto",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-4) var(--jx-space-3)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"install\"], & [part=\"access-link\"]": {
      "color": "var(--accent)",
      "textDecoration": "underline"
    },
    "& [part=\"failure\"]": {
      "$description": "The refusal from the last adoption, said above the list the reader is still looking at, because the list survives it: a repository with no readable project.json is a fact about that repository, and the ones beside it are still on offer. It is `failure` rather than `error` because `jx-textfield` draws a `[part=\"error\"]` of its own inside this same tree — the kit is light DOM, so a scoped rule on that name would style the filter field's error line too.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"access\"]": {
      "$description": "The listing is bounded by what the Jx Suite GitHub App was granted, so the dialog always offers a way out of that boundary rather than only saying the list is short.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)",
      "paddingTop": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "borderTop": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"access-note\"]": {
      "flex": "1 1 auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"access-links\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "picker"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "filter"
          },
          "$props": {
            "label": "Filter repositories",
            "placeholder": "Filter repositories…",
            "size": "sm",
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/filter"
            }
          },
          "oninput": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/setFilter"
                },
                "value": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "body-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/listState"
          },
          "cases": {
            "loading": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "Loading repositories…"
            },
            "empty-filter": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "No repositories match the filter."
            },
            "empty-write": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "No repositories with write access. Widen the Jx Suite GitHub App's repository access below, or ask a repository admin for write access."
            },
            "empty-install": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "No repositories are reachable yet. "
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "a",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "install",
                    "href": "${state.installUrl}",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "rel": "noreferrer"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Install the Jx Suite GitHub App"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": " to grant repository access, then use Refresh below."
                }
              ]
            },
            "empty-none": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty"
              },
              "textContent": "No repositories are reachable. Install the GitHub App (or widen its repository access) and try again."
            },
            "listed": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "list"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "$prototype": "Array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/rows"
                  },
                  "key": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/fullName"
                  },
                  "map": {
                    "tagName": "button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "row",
                      "type": "button",
                      "data-repo": "${$map.item.fullName}",
                      "title": "${$map.item.fullName}",
                      "disabled": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/disabled"
                      }
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/choose"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/fullName"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "name"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.fullName}"
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "meta"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "tag-slot",
                              "role": "none"
                            },
                            "style": {
                              "display": "contents"
                            },
                            "$switch": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/isJx"
                            },
                            "cases": {
                              "true": {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "badge"
                                },
                                "textContent": "Jx"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "private-slot",
                              "role": "none"
                            },
                            "style": {
                              "display": "contents"
                            },
                            "$switch": {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/isPrivate"
                            },
                            "cases": {
                              "true": {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "badge"
                                },
                                "textContent": "private"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "textContent": "${$map.item.meta}"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "busy-slot",
                          "role": "none"
                        },
                        "style": {
                          "display": "contents"
                        },
                        "$switch": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/importing"
                        },
                        "cases": {
                          "true": {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "busy"
                            },
                            "textContent": "Importing…"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "failure-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/hasFailure"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "failure"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.failure}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "access-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/hasAccess"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "access"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "access-note"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Missing a repository? Grant the Jx Suite GitHub App access to more of them:"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "access-links"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$prototype": "Array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/access"
                      },
                      "key": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/url"
                      },
                      "map": {
                        "tagName": "a",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "access-link",
                          "href": "${$map.item.url}",
                          "target": "_blank",
                          "rel": "noreferrer",
                          "title": "${$map.item.title}"
                        },
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "refresh"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "size": "sm",
                    "disabled": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/refreshDisabled"
                    }
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/refresh"
                        },
                        "value": []
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "Refresh"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
